#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adapt this workflow to your own system: the function accepts any 1D nearest-neighbor `SparsePauliOp`, so a different chain Hamiltonian, initial state, or set of observables runs the same PRE &rarr; FUNCTION &rarr; POST pipeline. See the full input/output contract in the [AQC Dynamics Template on GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter).\n"
msgstr "Adaptasikan alur kerja ini ke sistem kamu sendiri: fungsi ini menerima `SparsePauliOp` tetangga-terdekat 1D apa pun, sehingga Hamiltonian rantai, keadaan awal, atau kumpulan observable yang berbeda menjalankan pipeline PRE &rarr; FUNCTION &rarr; POST yang sama. Lihat kontrak input/output lengkap di [AQC Dynamics Template di GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
